$ | $\\frac{2}{3}$ |\n| ${f}_{Y}$ | $\\frac{7}{12}$ | $\\frac{5}{12}$ | $1$ |\n\nFinally, the marginal mass function for $Y$ is given by the following table:\n\n| $y$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{7}{12}$ | $\\frac{5}{12}$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2a12aa1c-7f4a-54d1-83b2-351e646b91bc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2a12aa1c-7f4a-54d1-83b2-351e646b91bc" :answer-field/id #uuid "2a12aa1c-7f4a-54d1-83b2-351e646b91bc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b4aab922-7142-59e3-9ec0-a4165d3b5e8f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d9dc8361-6f65-5afa-bb98-1ba96423cad0" "answer-27f46220-bcca-57b3-bf20-206ba24f672a" "answer-8f70b5a1-555a-5847-9c9e-14fddeb2c922" "answer-60103019-c70f-584a-91bc-6ad1f0e6d356" "answer-b4aab922-7142-59e3-9ec0-a4165d3b5e8f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d9dc8361-6f65-5afa-bb98-1ba96423cad0" :answer/id #uuid "d9dc8361-6f65-5afa-bb98-1ba96423cad0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $y$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{11}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{12}$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-27f46220-bcca-57b3-bf20-206ba24f672a" :answer/id #uuid "27f46220-bcca-57b3-bf20-206ba24f672a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $y$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{1}{3}$ | $\\frac{2}{3}$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8f70b5a1-555a-5847-9c9e-14fddeb2c922" :answer/id #uuid "8f70b5a1-555a-5847-9c9e-14fddeb2c922" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $y$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{3}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-60103019-c70f-584a-91bc-6ad1f0e6d356" :answer/id #uuid "60103019-c70f-584a-91bc-6ad1f0e6d356" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $y$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{5}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b4aab922-7142-59e3-9ec0-a4165d3b5e8f" :answer/id #uuid "b4aab922-7142-59e3-9ec0-a4165d3b5e8f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $y$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{7}{12}$ | $\\frac{5}{12}$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-3cc02d81-9348-594e-8ded-6e3235e0303a" :question/id #uuid "3cc02d81-9348-594e-8ded-6e3235e0303a" :question/math-academy-id "q-142829" :question/problem "| $f$ | $Y=0$ | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{3}{16}$ |\n| $X=1$ | $\\frac{1}{16}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ |\n\nGiven the joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ above for the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y,$ find the marginal mass function for $Y.$" :question/worked-solution "If the random variables $X$ and $Y$ have joint distribution with joint probability mass function $f(x,y),$ then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=x) & ={f}_{X}(x)={\\sum }_{y}f(x,y) \\\\ P(Y=y) & ={f}_{Y}(y)={\\sum }_{x}f(x,y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${f}_{X}(x)$ and ${f}_{Y}(y)$ are the marginal mass functions for $X$ and $Y,$ respectively.\n\nIn this case, the marginal distribution for $X$ corresponds to the row totals, and the marginal distribution for $Y$ corresponds to the column totals. Let's add these row and column totals to our table:\n\n| $f$ | $Y=0$ | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ | ${f}_{X}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{3}{16}$ | $\\frac{9}{16}$ |\n| $X=1$ | $\\frac{1}{16}$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{7}{16}$ |\n| ${f}_{Y}$ | $\\frac{3}{16}$ | $\\frac{3}{8}$ | $\\frac{7}{16}$ | $1$ |\n\nFinally, the marginal mass function for $Y$ is given by the following table:\n\n| $y$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{3}{16}$ | $\\frac{3}{8}$ | $\\frac{7}{16}$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e5e5f9a1-96ce-57c8-a2a0-d12f181059fe"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e5e5f9a1-96ce-57c8-a2a0-d12f181059fe" :answer-field/id #uuid "e5e5f9a1-96ce-57c8-a2a0-d12f181059fe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-eba5a41e-ccab-54c4-ae69-913bcaa78938" :answer-field/choices ["answer-99751faa-5e23-5b7c-8748-eaff2b166227" "answer-47cbe9c7-c2fe-515c-8a26-565f480c6ed4" "answer-94d69421-fdca-596b-899b-c69aeed1408b" "answer-4c52c6ec-6a42-5306-85bb-053471e5acb5" "answer-eba5a41e-ccab-54c4-ae69-913bcaa78938"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-99751faa-5e23-5b7c-8748-eaff2b166227" :answer/id #uuid "99751faa-5e23-5b7c-8748-eaff2b166227" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $y$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{3}{4}$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-47cbe9c7-c2fe-515c-8a26-565f480c6ed4" :answer/id #uuid "47cbe9c7-c2fe-515c-8a26-565f480c6ed4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $y$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{9}{16}$ | $\\frac{7}{16}$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-94d69421-fdca-596b-899b-c69aeed1408b" :answer/id #uuid "94d69421-fdca-596b-899b-c69aeed1408b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $y$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4c52c6ec-6a42-5306-85bb-053471e5acb5" :answer/id #uuid "4c52c6ec-6a42-5306-85bb-053471e5acb5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $y$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{1}{8}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{5}{8}$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-eba5a41e-ccab-54c4-ae69-913bcaa78938" :answer/id #uuid "eba5a41e-ccab-54c4-ae69-913bcaa78938" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "| $y$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{3}{16}$ | $\\frac{3}{8}$ | $\\frac{7}{16}$ |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186162309 :question/problem "| $f$ | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ | $Y=3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.2$ | $0.1$ | $0.1$ |\n| $X=1$ | $0.1$ | $0.25$ | $0.25$ |\n\nGiven the joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ above for the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y,$ calculate $P(Y\\le 2).$" :question/worked-solution "If the random variables $X$ and $Y$ have joint distribution with joint probability mass function $f(x,y),$ then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=x) & ={f}_{X}(x)={\\sum }_{y}f(x,y) \\\\ P(Y=y) & ={f}_{Y}(y)={\\sum }_{x}f(x,y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${f}_{X}(x)$ and ${f}_{Y}(y)$ are the marginal mass functions for $X$ and $Y,$ respectively.\n\nIn this case, the marginal distribution for $X$ corresponds to the row totals, and the marginal distribution for $Y$ corresponds to the column totals. Let's add these row and column totals to our table:\n\n| $f$ | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ | $Y=3$ | ${f}_{X}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.2$ | $0.1$ | $0.1$ | $0.4$ |\n| $X=1$ | $0.1$ | $0.25$ | $0.25$ | $0.6$ |\n| ${f}_{Y}$ | $0.3$ | $0.35$ | $0.35$ | $1$ |\n\nThe marginal mass function for $Y$ is given in the following table:\n\n| $y$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $0.3$ | $0.35$ | $0.35$ |\n\nFinally, using the table of values of the marginal mass function for $Y,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(Y\\le 2) & =P(Y\\in \\{1,2\\}) \\\\  & =P(Y=1)+P(Y=2) \\\\  & =0.3+0.35 \\\\  & =0.65.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186159056 :answer-field/correct 17592186159059 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id 17592186162163 :activity/expected-seconds 420.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]}]
